cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If TorchLean is useful in your work, please cite the paper below and the software version you used."
title: "TorchLean"
abstract: >-
  TorchLean is a Lean 4 library for shape-checked tensor computation, neural-network training,
  graph import and transformation, numerical verification, and proofs about machine-learning
  programs. It provides CPU execution, CUDA backends, automatic differentiation, configurable
  floating-point semantics, and verification tools within one formal system.
